BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Meditation Group
UID:event_315537828@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260722T033031Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260723T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260723T203000
SUMMARY:Evening Group Meditation IN-PERSON or ONLINE
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Meditation Meetup Group\nLed by Founding teacher Ron
 ya Banks or AIM Facilitator Wallace Bohanan\, our Thursday evening group m
 editation sessions will continue to consist of a guided meditation (30 min
 utes)\, a few-minute break\, a dharma talk by the teacher (30 minutes)\, a
 nd then Q & A/Discussion (30 minutes).\n\nMeditation instructions will be 
 given for beginners.\n\nThe session begins promptly at 7:00 pm. If online\
 , please mute your audio during the guided meditation and talk.\n\nLocatio
 n\n\nMindSpring Building\n966 Tunnel Road\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nPlease
  Donate ($10 Suggested)\n\nWe need your generosity now more than ever befo
 re. Please hit the Donate Button to your right and donate whatever you can
  afford. Or become one of our monthly sustaining donars. (The suggested mi
 nimum donation is $10\, but no one is turned away for lack of funds.)\n\nG
 roup Meditation Guidelines\n\n* Arrive several minutes early. You are welc
 ome to greet others before we start.\n* Turn off your cell phones and othe
 r beeping devices.\n* Sit in a comfortable position\, chairs are provided\
 , bring your own cushions\, blankets\, or props.\n* If on zoom\, please mu
 te yourself during guided meditation\, and talk\, and then unmute yourself
  to share during the discussion.\n\nOnline Zoom Instructions\n\nWeb link: 
 https://us02web.zoom.us/j/9742035476\n\nIf you have updated to the new Zoo
 m Install Package\, the Web link is: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/9742035476\
 n\nPasscode: 879173\n\nMeeting ID: 974 203 5476\n\n* Thank you for helping
  us create this peaceful and safe refuge.\n\nThank you for helping us crea
 te this peaceful and safe refuge. Meditating with others enriches and supp
 orts your practice - in person or even online. We hope you will join us!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-meditation-meetup-group/eve
 nts/315537828/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260703T232609Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260703T232609Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Meditation Group
UID:event_315571057@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260722T033031Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260726T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260726T113000
SUMMARY:Sunday - Group Meditation ONLINE
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Meditation Meetup Group\nLet's Meditate Together!\n\
 nJoin us for an online Sunday morning Zoom session\, which includes:\n\\- 
 40 minutes unguided silent meditation \\(Radiating Loving Kindness at the 
 end\\)\n\\- Watch a mindfulness/Buddhist information video \\(25 minutes\\
 )\n\\- Group Discussion/Q&A period \\(20 minutes\\)\n\nSimply go to our Zo
 om link ahead of time and follow the prompts:\n\nhttps://us02web.zoom.us/j
 /9742035476\nMeeting ID: 974 203 5476\nPasscode: 879173\n\nLed by Founding
  teacher Ronya Banks or one of our trained AIM Facilitators (Kendra or Wal
 lace).\n\nAdults of all experience levels are welcome to attend. Meditatio
 n instruction will be given for beginners upon request.\n\nThe session beg
 ins promptly at 10:00 am. Please mute your audio unless you are sharing du
 ring the Discussion portion of the meeting.\n\nGroup Meditation Guidelines
 \n\n* Arrive several minutes early. You are welcome to greet others before
  we start.\n* Turn off your cell phones and other beeping devices.\n* Sit 
 in a comfortable position\, either in your chair or cushions at home (pref
 erably in a quiet room)\n* Please mute yourself during guided meditation\,
  and talk\, and then unmute yourself to share during the discussion.\n* Pl
 ease remain still and do not carry your computer around\, as it makes othe
 rs dizzy.\n* Thank you for helping us create this peaceful and safe refuge
 .\n\nMeditating with others enriches and supports your practice - even onl
 ine. We hope you will join us!\n\nBy Donation (Please Donate)\n\n1. Via Pa
 ypal - https://www.paypal.me/ashevilleinsight\n2. Via Website - https://ww
 w.ashevillemeditation.com/make-donation\n\nI hope to see you there\,\n-Ron
 ya Banks
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-meditation-meetup-group/eve
 nts/315571057/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260706T141138Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260706T141138Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
